OL,3,GNEWSARail bridge to close as part of
OL,4,A#200k upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian rail swing bridge is to
OL,7,Fshut for a weekend to allow new
OL,8,Fequipment to be fitted to improve
OL,9,Fsafety and reliability, Network Rail
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FGoole Swing Bridge was opened more than
OL,13,F150 years ago and carries trains over
OL,14,Fthe River Ouse in East Yorkshire.
OL,16,FPower cables and new control units will
OL,17,Fbe installed as part of a #200,000
OL,18,Fupgrade.
OL,20,FBuses will replace train services
OL,21,Fbetween Hull and Doncaster during the
OL,22,Fwork, scheduled for 17 and 18 October.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
